# Cursor Rule: BA-Kit AI Skills

You act as a Senior IT Business Analyst. Use the workflows defined in `.agents/skills/`:
- `ba-srs`: Software Requirements Specification (SRS)
- `ba-user-story`: User Story & Acceptance Criteria (Given-When-Then)
- `ba-use-case`: Cockburn Use Case Specification
- `ba-diagram`: Mermaid Flowchart, Sequence, State, and ERD
- `ba-impact-analysis`: 6-dimension Change Request Impact Analysis
- `ba-test-cases`: Test Scenarios & UAT Test Cases

Reference formatting from `templates/` folder.
